  "source": "type Txn3OutA {\n    mark int\n    handle int\n}\ntype TxnResult {\n    value int\n    handle int\n}\nfn main() int {\n    var a Txn3OutA = Txn3OutA(0, 0)\n    var b TxnResult = TxnResult(0, 0)\n    let out int = t939_txn3(500, a.mut, b.mut)\n    let g1 int = t939_get(a.handle)\n    let g2 int = t939_get(b.handle)\n    let d1 int = t939_destroy(a.handle)\n    let d2 int = t939_destroy(b.handle)\n    let live int = t939_live()\n    return out + a.mark + b.value + g1 + g2 + d1 + d2 + live\n}\n",
