  "source": "fn main() int {\n    let h int = t939_create(4)\n    let g int = t939_clone(h)\n    let a int = t939_get(h)\n    let b int = t939_get(g)\n    let d1 int = t939_destroy(h)\n    let d2 int = t939_destroy(g)\n    let live int = t939_live()\n    return a + b + d1 + d2 + live\n}\n",
